                We will implement: Click on Cue Ball -> Drag Mouse ANYWHERE relative to ball center. The line drawn is the AIM LINE connecting ball and mouse. Power = distance. Release shoots in direction of (Mouse - Ball) ??? No that's "Push Forward". 

                // Okay, let's try this specific logic for Playability + Prompt Compliance:
